{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live-D Corporation slowly took control of society, enforcing their power through a private army and secret human experiments. Captured and taken to a hidden underground complex, former soldier Marius was subjected to a serum meant to grant eternal life - instead he fell into a coma and awakened ten years later immune to the experiment, only to find the abandoned facility overrun by alien-like creatures created from failed test subjects that spread and destroyed the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight to survive, uncover what happened during those ten years, and find your way back to the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/87b08d3131b64f72a595e607ed7bf51c.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/87b08d3131b64f72a595e607ed7bf51c.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is intense and grounded, with weapons that feature realistic recoil, bullet spread, and physical impact. Every shot matters, and every encounter can play out differently depending on how you use your tools and surroundings. Grenades can clear groups instantly, while well-timed environmental explosions can save precious ammo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS-DRIVEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/cdbffe36e3e1c1bad655a1fda7988b25.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/cdbffe36e3e1c1bad655a1fda7988b25.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of LeftUnknown is built around physics and interactivity. Most objects aren\u2019t just props - they can be moved, thrown, stacked, or used creatively. The environment reacts to your actions, letting you solve problems, fight enemies, or create opportunities using the world itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL &amp; RESOURCE MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/0ea0049ca48e73b4fcd33d1beb326b10.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/0ea0049ca48e73b4fcd33d1beb326b10.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on preparation and smart decision-making. Your inventory has limited space and is weight-based, forcing you to balance firepower with essentials. You\u2019ll need to monitor your health, stamina, and injuries, using med-kits, food, and bandages to stay in fighting condition. Scavenging, buying, and selling items becomes key to long-term survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENVIRONMENTAL STORYTELLING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/13537b24f840f8a669671d3edbc5a870.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/13537b24f840f8a669671d3edbc5a870.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds through exploration. Scattered notes and diaries reveal what happened inside the facility, but they also serve a practical purpose. Players who pay attention can discover door codes, and clues that lead to valuable rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SANDBOX FREEDOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/8f77e2ae5de5c094d43b04f84d801533.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/8f77e2ae5de5c094d43b04f84d801533.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LeftUnknown embraces player experimentation. Console commands allow you to spawn objects, enable god mode, or manipulate the world for fun. Whether you want a serious survival experience or a chaotic sandbox playground, the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NIGHTMARE MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/3dbfc6ff9408e8a881e8c820fc5df674.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/3dbfc6ff9408e8a881e8c820fc5df674.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmare Mode offers a pure survival challenge for players who want to test their limits. Face endless waves of enemies and fight to stay alive as long as possible. Every kill earns points, and every second survived pushes your score higher. Compete against friends or players worldwide on the leaderboards and prove how long you can last when the odds never stop stacking against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>*This game is made by a solo developer</i></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I don't like them","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977480/fa6ba603119c5dc0c9cdd5ddf3104648570f87bf.jpg"},{"name":"Who needs saves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977480/be68fe99d6dd9fba216f7f7d66902bc6234b9cc1.jpg"},{"name":"Unachievable","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977480/f40c0698e1cc5b4dd546cfd9162247389126da3b.jpg"},{"name":"Won't go down easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977480/dfef7244269c51409353ea7639bbf571352734fc.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable (mostly)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977480/e1c1deba39d488bd97285041fcdd1756208f88a6.jpg"},{"name":"You can't kill me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3977480/279f3323bbaedc1ad18fc7aa22f1bff533ac2365.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3977480?t=1772359641","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/f75389f286cc61fa9dd6aac99b3e0fcb23c6b031/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772359641","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/3e64ac8279e301aaef0bef7f13b9b031bce09875/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772359641","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/3e64ac8279e301aaef0bef7f13b9b031bce09875/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772359641","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game includes blood, frequent gunfights, and a grim post-apocalyptic atmosphere"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live-D Corporation slowly took control of society, enforcing their power through a private army and secret human experiments. Captured and taken to a hidden underground complex, former soldier Marius was subjected to a serum meant to grant eternal life - instead he fell into a coma and awakened ten years later immune to the experiment, only to find the abandoned facility overrun by alien-like creatures created from failed test subjects that spread and destroyed the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight to survive, uncover what happened during those ten years, and find your way back to the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/87b08d3131b64f72a595e607ed7bf51c.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/87b08d3131b64f72a595e607ed7bf51c.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is intense and grounded, with weapons that feature realistic recoil, bullet spread, and physical impact. Every shot matters, and every encounter can play out differently depending on how you use your tools and surroundings. Grenades can clear groups instantly, while well-timed environmental explosions can save precious ammo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PHYSICS-DRIVEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/cdbffe36e3e1c1bad655a1fda7988b25.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/cdbffe36e3e1c1bad655a1fda7988b25.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of LeftUnknown is built around physics and interactivity. Most objects aren\u2019t just props - they can be moved, thrown, stacked, or used creatively. The environment reacts to your actions, letting you solve problems, fight enemies, or create opportunities using the world itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL &amp; RESOURCE MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/0ea0049ca48e73b4fcd33d1beb326b10.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/0ea0049ca48e73b4fcd33d1beb326b10.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on preparation and smart decision-making. Your inventory has limited space and is weight-based, forcing you to balance firepower with essentials. You\u2019ll need to monitor your health, stamina, and injuries, using med-kits, food, and bandages to stay in fighting condition. Scavenging, buying, and selling items becomes key to long-term survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENVIRONMENTAL STORYTELLING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/13537b24f840f8a669671d3edbc5a870.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/13537b24f840f8a669671d3edbc5a870.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds through exploration. Scattered notes and diaries reveal what happened inside the facility, but they also serve a practical purpose. Players who pay attention can discover door codes, and clues that lead to valuable rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SANDBOX FREEDOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/8f77e2ae5de5c094d43b04f84d801533.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/8f77e2ae5de5c094d43b04f84d801533.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LeftUnknown embraces player experimentation. Console commands allow you to spawn objects, enable god mode, or manipulate the world for fun. Whether you want a serious survival experience or a chaotic sandbox playground, the choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NIGHTMARE MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras/3dbfc6ff9408e8a881e8c820fc5df674.avif?t=1772359641\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/extras_big/3dbfc6ff9408e8a881e8c820fc5df674.webp?t=1772359641 width=1560 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmare Mode offers a pure survival challenge for players who want to test their limits. Face endless waves of enemies and fight to stay alive as long as possible. Every kill earns points, and every second survived pushes your score higher. Compete against friends or players worldwide on the leaderboards and prove how long you can last when the odds never stop stacking against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>*This game is made by a solo developer</i></h2>","developers":["JustoGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3977480/1700e87688a918ebd8bfbfc7446079df0b7b5e8c/header.jpg?t=1772359641","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3977480/1884674034/eae0ef5684a93e9fdad1